{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach, then grab, check properties, and perform specific task. Else, scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    />",
